      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Generate clips with sound from pictures in real time with H3 Reference Turbo Realtime. Connect each image to a picture socket; prompts call them Picture 1, Picture 2 and so on, in socket order. Queue it and the clip plays in the Reactor Realtime window. Write the next clip's prompt there and press Queue new shot, or Queue continuation to carry on from the last clip's final frame; every clip uses the same pictures. Press Save to save the take under reactor/realtime.\n\nH3 Reference Turbo Realtime prompt guide: https://docs.reactor.inc/model-api-reference/h3-reference-to-video-turbo-realtime/prompt-guide\n\nSet your Reactor API key in this plugin's config.ini."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
